cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AIFont Text Rendering Ledger"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "AIFont"
    website: "https://aifont.ai"
abstract: >-
  Images from five text-to-image models (GPT Image, Nano Banana, Grok Imagine,
  Seedream, Qwen-Image), each asked to write a given word in a given lettering
  style, in eight languages and scripts. Every image is judged for whether the
  text is spelled exactly as requested, with error types and the text actually
  rendered. Prompts, upstream model versions and generation settings included.
keywords:
  - text-to-image
  - text rendering
  - typography
  - multilingual
  - CJK
  - Arabic
  - evaluation
  - dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://aifont.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Funovate-Technology/aifont-text-rendering"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23815210"
version: "1.1.1"
date-released: 2026-11-09
